"""Write a readable retained-results report from authoritative alias-aware data."""
from __future__ import annotations
import argparse
from html import escape
from pathlib import Path
from .campaign import read,save,utc

def main():
    parser=argparse.ArgumentParser();parser.add_argument('campaign',type=Path);parser.add_argument('--out',type=Path,required=True);args=parser.parse_args()
    r=read(args.campaign/'FINAL_ANALYSIS.json');args.out.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)
    rows=[]
    for s in r['selection']:
        group=[x for x in r['rows'] if all(x[k]==s[k] for k in ('q','k','locality'))]
        d={pid:x for x in group for pid in x['policies']}
        rows.append('<tr>'+''.join('<td>'+escape(str(x))+'</td>' for x in
            (s['q'],s['k'],s['locality'],f"{d['P0']['mean_ns']/1e6:.3f}",f"{d['P1']['mean_ns']/1e6:.3f}",
             f"{d['P2']['mean_ns']/1e6:.3f}",'/'.join(s['chosen_policies']),f"{s['regret_percent']:.2f}%"))+'</tr>')
    uncertainty=[]
    for x in r['rows']:
        uncertainty.append('<tr>'+''.join('<td>'+escape(str(v))+'</td>' for v in
            (x['q'],x['k'],x['locality'],'/'.join(x['policies']),x['independent_processes'],
             f"{x['predicted_ns']/1e6:.3f}",f"{x['mean_ns']/1e6:.3f}",
             f"[{x['mean_95ci_ns'][0]/1e6:.3f}, {x['mean_95ci_ns'][1]/1e6:.3f}]",f"{x['ape_percent']:.2f}%",x['loads']))+'</tr>')
    html='''<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>MoE策略真实执行与预测对照</title><style>body{margin:0;background:white;color:#161616;font-family:"Microsoft YaHei","Times New Roman",sans-serif;line-height:1.8}main{max-width:1120px;margin:auto;padding:36px 28px 65px}h1{font-size:28px}h2{font-size:21px;margin-top:32px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:14px}td,th{padding:9px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;text-align:left}th{background:#f3f4f5}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.note{background:#fff7ed;border-left:3px solid #d55e00;padding:12px 16px}.good{background:#eef7fb;border-left:3px solid #0072b2;padding:12px 16px}a{color:#00639a}.scroll{overflow-x:auto}</style><main><h1>MoE策略真实执行与预测对照</h1><p>2026-10-29。沿用已写定的40个条件，完成两轮独立硬件实验。主结果采用完整动作生命周期采样后冻结参数的新一轮验证；原有热态孤立动作实验全部保留。</p><div class="good"><strong>主结果：</strong>40个策略标签/工作负载条件归并为24个实际不同的执行程序；120个新进程执行，输出与独立参考的最大绝对误差为5.994×10⁻⁸。24个不同程序的平均耗时预测MAPE为8.26%，最大误差30.29%；8个工作负载中，预测选中的执行程序都取得了实测点均值中的最低值。</div><h2>实验究竟做了什么</h2><p>H=256，I=512，8个F32专家，top-2完整SwiGLU、带权聚合和一次residual；每次输入1或32个token，连续调用8次。GPU专家槽位2或4个，分别为3或6 MiB权重池，主存8个专家权重12 MiB。路由为可审查的hot/capacity-sensitive合成序列。它是真实CPU/GPU算术和真实数据复制的专家FFN块实验，不是完整OLMoE模型策略的端到端复现。</p><p>P0全CPU；P1全GPU、用后释放；P2全GPU、LRU；P3按当前公开完整路径成本选择CPU/GPU、用后释放；P4同样选设备并使用LRU。没有未来路由预知，没有异步重叠，也没有因果预取性能结果。</p><h2>主要数据</h2><p>下表单位为毫秒，使用相同实际程序的全部进程均值合并计算。q=1时P0/P3/P4相同；q=32时P1/P3相同、P2/P4相同。不能把这些相同程序的测量波动解释为策略收益。</p><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>q</th><th>K</th><th>路由</th><th>CPU</th><th>GPU用后释放</th><th>GPU LRU</th><th>预测选中的等价策略</th><th>点均值regret</th></tr></thead><tbody>'''+''.join(rows)+'''</tbody></table></div><h2>可以得出什么</h2><p>小token专家计算在本机更适合CPU；32-token条件中GPU与LRU方案更合适。hot路由下，LRU使权重加载从16次、24 MiB下降至2次、3 MiB；capacity-sensitive路由中K=2仍加载16次，K=4降至8次、12 MiB。上述加载次数由独立语义推导并与原生执行核对。</p><p>例如q=32、K=2、hot，GPU LRU为4.788 ms，95%进程均值区间[4.470,5.106]；用后释放为10.625 ms，[7.311,13.939]。capacity-sensitive、K=2时两方案分别为11.693 ms与12.077 ms，区间明显重叠，不能把这3.18%的点均值差称为显著优势。</p><div class="note"><strong>仍然存在的边界：</strong>q=1、K=2、capacity-sensitive两种GPU策略都加载16次，但实测时间不同；用后释放总复用槽位0，LRU使用多个槽位，因此其预建图/端口与运行历史也不同，还叠加测量波动。不能把该差距解释为缓存命中减少了传输，也不能据此说所有低层实现选择都可以忽略。最高30.29%的误差仍需保留。</div><h2>校准与独立性</h2><p>完整生命周期校准使用seed=31002，与验证seed=41002不同。每个q/K配置下测量CPU、GPU用后释放和GPU LRU，分别采用两种路由；每个校准序列2个新进程，每进程20个带动作时间戳的完整序列。按每进程动作类别均值汇总参数，冻结所有程序和预测后才运行120个新的bare验证进程；每个名义条件3个进程、每进程10个完整样本。验证内部不逐动作打点。初始化、权重生成、图创建、逻辑缓存reset和JSON不在序列计时内，必要的加载、激活搬运、专家运算、等待和聚合在内。</p><p>modeling仍然按LOAD、RELEASE、EXPERT和COMBINE完整响应组成串行耗时；profiling改变的是参数采样的生命周期匹配方式。这不是新的动态设备状态模型，也没有用验证延迟拟合补偿常数。原始40标签统计为MAPE 10.76%、最大36.04%；按24个不同程序报告为8.26%、最大30.29%，两种分母均保留。</p><h2>逐条件误差与不确定性</h2><p>区间由独立进程均值计算，等价标签合并后每个不同程序有3、6或9个独立进程；Student-t区间。区间不代表一般设备状态分布，也不保证每次调用或尾延迟准确。</p><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>q</th><th>K</th><th>路由</th><th>等价标签</th><th>进程数</th><th>预测ms</th><th>实测ms</th><th>95%区间ms</th><th>APE</th><th>LOAD</th></tr></thead><tbody>'''+''.join(uncertainty)+'''</tbody></table></div><h2>语义与物理检查</h2><p>40个条件均核对独立LOAD次数、16次被选专家执行和8次聚合；各条件改变后4步未来路由，前4步的决策与观察哈希均不变。覆盖活跃槽位、未加载计算、重复/遗漏专家、提前聚合等非法计划被拒绝，错误residual由独立数值参考检出。原生执行严格检查槽位所有权和复制字节；CUDA私有工作区仍标为未知，因此只认证专家权重池，不能声称总显存完全准确。</p><h2>证据位置</h2><p>主数据：<code>Simulator/build/moe-policy-lifecycle-20261029-v2/FINAL_ANALYSIS.json</code>；图表汇总：<code>PAPER_TABLE.csv</code>。每个条件的program、编译记录、预测、数值参考、120个原生输出及各自request/process/verification记录均已保留。原热态校准实验保存在<code>Simulator/build/moe-policy-campaign-20261029-v1/</code>，独立审查在<code>Simulator/build/v5-independent-audit-20261029/</code>。汇总器的旧seed标签错误已在<code>SUMMARY_METADATA_CORRECTION.json</code>说明，原生输入和测量文件未改动。</p></main></html>'''
    target=args.out/'REPORT_zh.html'
    with target.open('x',encoding='utf-8',newline='\n') as f:f.write(html)
    notes='''We evaluate a routed F32 expert-FFN boundary with H=256, I=512, eight experts and top-2 selection. The matrix crosses q=1/32, two/four physical GPU weight slots and two auditable eight-call route sequences. Five Python policy labels combine fixed/current-cost execution with release-after-use/LRU, plus a CPU reference. Current-cost decisions use only disclosed routes and current residency. Initialization, graph construction and logical resets are outside the timer; weight loading, activation I/O, synchronized SwiGLU and weighted residual combination are inside. No asynchronous overlap, prefetch or full-model policy replay is claimed.

Forty nominal conditions reduce to 24 distinct native programs. Exact aliases are pooled before ranking, yielding three, six or nine independent process means per distinct condition from 120 fresh validation processes, each with ten bare samples. Parameters come from separate-seed complete-lifecycle calibration and freeze before validation. All outputs agree with an independent NumPy float64 reference on the declared F32 values; maximum absolute error is 5.994e-8 and maximum relative L2 error is 3.885e-8. Copy payloads and bounded slot ownership agree with the compiled actions. Future-route suffix changes preserve every tested public prefix.

Over 24 distinct programs, mean-latency prediction MAPE is 8.26% (median 4.85%, maximum 30.29%); the unpooled 40-label summary is 10.76% (maximum 36.04%). Observed point-mean choice regret is zero in the eight workload groups. This does not establish a statistically unique winner: at q=32, K=2 and capacity-sensitive routes, GPU release/LRU means are 12.077/11.693 ms with overlapping process-level intervals. Under hot routes, LRU lowers weight loads from 16 to two (24 to 3 MiB); capacity-sensitive K=4 lowers them to eight (12 MiB), while K=2 still needs 16. Current-cost uses CPU at q=1 and GPU at q=32, so identical labels cannot demonstrate distinct policy gains.

Residual errors remain. Release-after-use repeatedly selects slot zero, whereas LRU may use several slots and therefore different prebuilt graph/port inventories and histories. Same-transfer-count timing differences cannot be attributed solely to cache hits. Lifecycle-matched measured response parameters improve boundary matching but do not constitute a general dynamic-device-state model. Unknown CUDA-private workspace prevents certification of total VRAM occupancy.
'''
    with (args.out/'PAPER_NOTES_EN.txt').open('x',encoding='utf-8',newline='\n') as f:f.write(notes)
    print(str(target))

if __name__=='__main__':main()
